<title>SWEDEN: Swedish March trade surplus 9.1 bln Skr.</title>
<headline>Swedish March trade surplus 9.1 bln Skr.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's March trade surplus was 9.1 billion crowns, Statistics Sweden said on Friday.  </p>
<p> SWEDISH TRADE BALANCE     March '97  Feb '97    March 96</p>
<p> Exports			 49.7	 48.8	 51.1</p>
<p> Imports			 40.6	 38.5	 39.7</p>
<p> Trade balance		 +9.1	 +10.3	+11.4</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of crowns. Analysts polled by Reuters had forecast a surplus of 11.4 billion crowns.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, 46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
